ng's happening here locally  at our facility in flint  clint's an underdog it's a city that's  full of possibilities and just so many  amazing people  that live and coincide here so much  talent is in flint it's just people just  have to give us opportunity  to see it for themselves really but the  great thing  about flint is that no matter what comes  our way  we gonna find a way no matter what  so genesee's supply chain is really  uniquely within 180 mile radius of flint  michigan  our goal is to keep all of our  manufacturing production and material  sourcing as close to flint as possible  our polishing bags are sewn at the new  life center on the north end of flint  the bags are even made from recycled  plastic water bottles and they're sewn  here locally new life center employees  they're structurally unemployable and  trains them with sewing skills  and gives them pathways to employment  they're super rooted in the community  and aligned with the same values that  genesee holds  i want people to know that we are so  much more than  what everyone has seen on the news i  hope that someone actually  sees all the talent that we really have  and actually  tap into that talents but actually make  someone  feel that they can be a better them i  think genesee  is one of many solutions  in making life better here in flint for  individuals  and really just using our business as an  opportunity to amplify the voices of a  community  genesee's really setting a new standard  of how to do business  in a way that takes into account people  and planet  we need to create sustainable solutions  so that we can protect our resources  and actually have a future environment  you
 

